<Base title="About" description="Who we are and how Trust-Wise writes its travel guides.">
  <section class="wrap page prose">
    <h1>About Trust-Wise</h1>
    <p>Trust-Wise publishes practical travel guides for Malaysian travellers. We focus on the things that actually matter: how to get there, where to stay, what it costs, and what to bring.</p>
    <p>We only recommend hotels, tours and products we would use ourselves. Some links earn us a commission — see our <a href="/disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
